<servinfosub id = "AENLJA0A1134013003">
<title>
DTC Confirmation Procedure
</title>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
Check that the following condition is met in this “DTC Confirmation Procedure”.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Battery voltage &#62; 8.5 V
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention3>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Run engine at idle speed for 10 sec.
</ptxt>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLJA0A1134013004">
<title>
DTC Troubleshooting
</title>
<diag type = "test" id = "AENLJA0A1134013005">
<testgroup id = "AENLJA0A1134013006">
<question>
Was “Engine and Emission Control System Check” performed?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to Step 2.
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to 
<intxref refid = "AENLJA0A1134001">Engine and Emission Control System Check:K12D</intxref>
.
</ptxt>
</action>
</testgroup>
<testgroup id = "AENLJA0A1134013007">
<title>
Exhaust OCV power supply circuit check
</title>
<test1>
<ptxt>
When ignition is “OFF”, disconnect connector from exhaust OCV.
</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Check for proper terminal connection to exhaust OCV connector.
</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>
If connections is OK, set ignition “ON”.
</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Check that voltage between “A1” and ground is battery voltage.
</ptxt>
</test1>
<question>
Is check result OK?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to Step 3.
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Repair or replace defective wire harness.
</ptxt>
</action>
</testgroup>
<testgroup id = "AENLJA0A1134013008">
<title>
Exhaust OCV drive circuit check
</title>
<test1>
<ptxt>
When ignition “OFF”, disconnect “C01” and “E01” connectors from ECM.
</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Check for proper terminal connection to “C01” and “E01” connectors.
</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>
If connections are OK, check the following points.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Resistance of “A2” circuit: less than 1 &#937;
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Resistance between “A2” circuit and ground: infinity
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Resistance between “A1” circuit terminal and “A2” circuit terminal at exhaust OCV connector: infinity
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Voltage of “A2” circuit: approx. 0 V (When ignition is “ON”)
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</test1>
<question>
Is check result OK?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to Step 4.
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Repair or replace defective wire harness.
</ptxt>
</action>
</testgroup>
<testgroup id = "AENLJA0A1134013009">
<title>
Exhaust OCV check
</title>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Check exhaust OCV. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLJA0A1336029"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</test1>
<question>
Is check result OK?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to Step 5.
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Replace exhaust OCV.
</ptxt>
</action>
</testgroup>
<testgroup id = "AENLJA0A1134013010">
<title>
Troubleshooting of other DTC(s) at the same time
</title>
<question>
Is other DTC(s) detected together?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to troubleshooting for applicable DTC.
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Replace ECM and recheck DTC. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLJA0A1336001"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</action>
</testgroup>
</diag>
